435},{"ratio":0.91,"watchRatio":0.45840000000000003},{"ratio":0.92,"watchRatio":0.45255},{"ratio":0.93,"watchRatio":0.4476},{"ratio":0.94,"watchRatio":0.44489999999999996},{"ratio":0.95,"watchRatio":0.43845},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.4322},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.42264999999999997},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.40980000000000005},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39669999999999994},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3913}],"script":{"source_path":"2026-09-dyer-jallianwala-reward.md","words":156,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"General Dyer, ordered Jallian Wala Bagh,"},{"sec":1.9,"text":"and was never put on trial. And the"},{"sec":3.5,"text":"worst part came after [music] that. On"},{"sec":5.2,"text":"April 1919, he fired into the crowd for"},{"sec":7.6,"text":"10 minutes, and stopped only when ammo"},{"sec":9.8,"text":"ran out. And he never denied it. He told"},{"sec":12,"text":"the inquiry, he meant to strike terror"},{"sec":13.9,"text":"into whole of Punjab. He said he would"},{"sec":15.6,"text":"have used machine guns if the lane had"},{"sec":17.7,"text":"been wide enough. So, what did Britain"},{"sec":19.4,"text":"do to him? They just took away his"},{"sec":20.9,"text":"command. No charges were ever filed. And"},{"sec":23.2,"text":"when Parliament voted on that, the House"},{"sec":25,"text":"of Lords said removing him was unjust."},{"sec":27.4,"text":"This is the most depressing part."},{"sec":28.9,"text":"Ordinary British people got involved. A"},{"sec":30.8,"text":"London newspaper opened a fund for him."},{"sec":33,"text":"English ladies in India started Dyer"},{"sec":35,"text":"Appreciation Fund. Together, they raised"},{"sec":36.6,"text":"more than 20,000 pounds. As a final"},{"sec":38.8,"text":"insult to victims, they gifted him a"},{"sec":40.6,"text":"sword engraved with three words, \"Savior"},{"sec":42.9,"text":"of Punjab.\""}],"text":""}}